(* Variant control-go: the control stream of a Go client to the controller (AUD-5, #389;
   controller/internal/control/stream.go, Dial). The client does not check the certificate
   (InsecureSkipVerify): the Noise_IK handshake with the pinned static key of the controller, bound to the
   TLS exporter, is all that authenticates the controller. ranz-nodesim and the tests of the controller dial
   this way. The result is the one of tls443-nopin: the static key of the controller is the only secret that
   the client relies on. *)

process
  ( Setup()
  | Leaks()
  | !( Client(alice, bob, pin_off, bt_export, plabel_control, lab_exp_control, suite_ik) )
  | !( new sid: sessionid; Server(bob, alice, bt_export, plabel_control, lab_exp_control, suite_ik, sid) )
  )
